      "writtenOn": "2014-05-29T07:49:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So what credentials should be sent here? My Google ones? I don\u0027t really think it\u0027s a good idea to send my Google credentials to any service other than Google...\nI think in classic openid such credentials are sent only between a client and openid server (provider).",
